#### Utilization Thresholds

| Indicator | Utilization | Color |
|---|---|---|
| 🟢 Green (High) | ≥ 80% | #10B981 |
| 🟡 Yellow (Moderate) | ≥ 60% | #F59E0B |
| 🔴 Red (Low) | < 60% | #EF4444 |

#### Year Detection (5-Priority System)

1. Datetime objects in Excel cells (most reliable)
2. Sheet names with "CY YYYY" pattern
3. Sheet names with any year pattern
4. Filename containing year pattern
5. String patterns in DataFrame cells

